# Testing

Before writing or changing behavior, tests, or fixing test failures, read and follow **[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)** at the repo root.

## Quick reference

| Package | Tests | Run |
|---------|-------|-----|
| `packages/orchestrator` | `tests/test_*.py` | `cd packages/orchestrator && pytest` |
| `packages/web-demo` | `src/**/*.test.{ts,tsx}` | `cd packages/web-demo && npm run test` |

Integration tests in the orchestrator need Postgres, migrations, and `askbpl-seed` (see AGENTS.md). CI: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`.

## Non‑negotiables

- Failing test first (red → green → refactor)
- Test behavior, not implementation
- Run the relevant suite before reporting done; include command + exit status
- No `.only`, `.skip`, or deleted tests to green a build
